/**
 * p59 · Plozz — Intake
 *
 * A receiver and a display in one body: the shell stands wider above the glass
 * than below it, open at the top like a mouth, and the picture pools along the
 * rim the light comes over. Nothing draws the signal — the flare and the
 * reflection carry it.
 *
 * Eleven blue tones. The shell is shaded off its own distance field, so every
 * band follows the silhouette; the glass reflection is the lit rim carried onto
 * the picture, two deep at the lit left and gone before the right corner.
 * The face sits on the plain screen tone with a pixel of air all round.
 */
